                                "text": "In a Produce Stakes he had declared the former as Zelmyra, but observing some months afterwards that the name had been misprinted or mispublished as Zulima (probably owing to the Secretary of the meeting mistaking one filly for the other), the owner entered Zelmyra in 1839 for a race at the Curragh as Zelmyra with \"sister to Argirio\" added."
